   "start_page": 142,
   "summary": "This document is the concluding portion (pages 7–17) of an extensive, graded bibliography of American books recommended or sent for Japanese children, teachers, and schools. It classifies titles under categories including animals, biography, personal improvement, technology, communications, aviation, vocations, sports, hobbies, world and American history, geography, and regional life. The selected works emphasize American culture, democratic values, practical sciences, and international understanding across elementary through high school levels.",
